---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /research/
title: Research
description: "The research of Wayne Martin Mellinger, Ph.D.: bodies of work in Critical Interactionism, the sociology of interaction, homelessness and institutional abandonment, critical drug studies and religious naturalism, and current book and essay projects."
---
<header class="page-head">
  <h1>Research</h1>
  <p class="lede">Wayne’s newspaper columns, sociology, homelessness scholarship and religious-naturalist writing grow from a few long-running bodies of work. Below are those bodies of work, and the projects now in progress within them.</p>
</header>

<section aria-labelledby="bodies-of-work">
  <h2 id="bodies-of-work" class="section-title">Bodies of work</h2>
  <ul class="program-list">
    {%- for p in archive.programPages %}
    <li><a href="{{ p.path }}">{{ p.name }}</a> <span class="count">{{ p.works.length | pluralize('work') }}</span>
      <p>{{ p.description }}</p></li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="projects">
  <h2 id="projects" class="section-title">Current projects</h2>
  <p class="coverage">Status as of October 2026. Work in progress is described here, not published here; nothing on this page is a claim of publication.</p>
  {%- for p in archive.projects %}
  <article class="project" id="{{ p.id }}" aria-labelledby="{{ p.id }}-h">
    <h3 id="{{ p.id }}-h">{{ p.title }}</h3>
    <p class="status-line"><span class="status">{{ p.status }}</span>
      {%- if p.programList.length %} <span class="project-programs">{% for pr in p.programList %}<a href="{{ pr.path }}">{{ pr.name }}</a>{% if not loop.last %} · {% endif %}{% endfor %}</span>{% endif %}</p>
    <p>{{ p.summary }}</p>
    {%- if p.workList.length %}
    <details class="project-works">
      <summary>Related published work <span class="count">{{ p.workList.length }}</span></summary>
      <ul>
        {%- for w in p.workList %}
        <li><a href="{{ w.page or w.url or w.permalink }}">{{ w.title }}</a> <span class="work-venue">{{ w.collectionName }}{% if w.date %}, {{ w | dateLabel(true) }}{% endif %}</span></li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
    </details>
    {%- endif %}
  </article>
  {%- endfor %}
</section>
